                    <name>richTextValue</name>
                    <value>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Detail Executive Dashboards:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/lightning/n/Customer_Health?0.source=alohaHeader&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Customer Health&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;A series of charts that represent the current status of customer projects. This is a point in time view, and is meant to represent the current position, rather than a trend. The charts should be used to identify projects which are not running to plan, where executive oversight/review is required, or where a process to remedy should be instigated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/lightning/n/Company_Wealth?0.source=alohaHeader&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Company Wealth&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;A set of financial&amp;nbsp;charts that demonstrate&amp;nbsp;the past&amp;nbsp;and potential future revenues, alongside the cash generation position for the company. The information presented should be used to review&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;progress against plan and the likely outcome for quarter/year measured against the planned targets.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/lightning/n/People?0.source=alohaHeader&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;People&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Measures to demonstrate the historic and projected performance of the people within the business, including the resource demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/lightning/n/Growth_Value?0.source=alohaHeader&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Value&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Measures that demonstrate the historic growth and future growth potential of the business along with the quality of revenues. These figures can be used to present externally, the trajectory and potential of the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
